OL,3,ASinger Michael Kiwanuka reveals he is
OL,4,Arecovering from a stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added that "the brain injury I
OL,7,Fsuffered was quite severe so there's a
OL,8,Flot of rehab to be done", but told fans
OL,9,Fhe will "look forward to seeing you all
OL,10,Fsoon".
OL,12,FKiwanuka simultaneously announced the
OL,13,Frelease of his fifth album, titled
OL,14,FFudge, which was recorded before the
OL,15,Fstroke.
